config TCT_DEVICEINFO
	bool "TCT deviceinfo nodes for MMI tests"
	help
	  Say Y here to create the /sys/class/deviceinfo/device_info nodes
	  used by TALPAD (TALIH-PD2) factory/MMI tests, including the
	  aggregate "tct_all_deviceinfo" node. Each node stores a
	  name/value string pair written by the factory test tooling and
	  can be read back over sysfs; the aggregate node dumps all pairs
	  in "name:value;" format.
